OL,3,AMore than 1.9 million urged to evacuate
OL,4,Aas powerful typhoon batters Japan
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than 1.9 million people are under
OL,7,Fevacuation orders as Typhoon Dujuan
OL,8,Fbatters Japan
OL,10,FAs the country approaches midnight, our
OL,11,FTokyo correspondent says the rain has
OL,12,Flet up, but record-breaking rainfall
OL,13,Fhas been measured in multiple locations
OL,15,FIn Kanagawa, firefighters fear a woman
OL,16,Fhas been buried alive after a landslide
OL,17,Fcrushed a house, while a man in Chiba
OL,18,Fwas taken to hospital after being
OL,19,Ftrapped while working to clear debris
OL,21,FMore than 50,000 households in the
OL,22,Fregion are without power
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,314,300,200,140,0,100
